# ScreenReaderStatusMessage Utility

This utility provides a WCAG 2.1 AA compliant way to announce status updates to screen readers.

## Usage
Wrap your status text in the component:
`<ScreenReaderStatusMessage message="13 results found" />`

To show text visually while keeping it accessible:
`<ScreenReaderStatusMessage message="13 results found" visible={true} />`

## Testing
